<title>POLAND: RAFAKO REVISES DOWN 1996 NET PROFIT.</title>
<headline>RAFAKO REVISES DOWN 1996 NET PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rafako preliminary results for</p>
<p>financial year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						  1996	  1995</p>
<p>    operating profit		    19.43   vs   45.01 loss</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 3.43   vs   54.54 loss</p>
<p>    net profit			     3.43   vs   56.45 loss</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Fabryka Kotlow Rafako SA.</p>
<p>Earlier the firm reported its net profit at 4.4 million zlotys.</p>
<p>    net sales			    366.20   vs  359.23</p>
<p>    costs of sales		     314.66   vs  298.92</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		 0.03   vs	--</p>
<p>    income tax				 --   vs    1.91</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   7.52   vs    9.00</p>
<p>    financial costs		     24.25   vs   18.74</p>
<p>    investment			     5.68   vs   20.71</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
